From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:48:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] art: nterp riscv64 entry without Zbs bexti

The zero-arg fast path tested the static flag with bexti (Zbs); srli +
andi 1 gives the same rd = (rs >> imm) & 1 in the base ISA.

Licence of the patched file: Apache-2.0 (its AOSP header).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [AOSP targets rv64gcv_zba_zbb_zbs]
Patch-Reason: the riscv64 host target ISA has no Zbs (arches.toml [riscv64.host]; the test host lacks it), so the assembler rejects bexti and libart cannot link; the march is the target, not a build setting to widen, and nothing outside the source can replace the instruction
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 runtime/interpreter/mterp/riscv64/main.S | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/runtime/interpreter/mterp/riscv64/main.S b/runtime/interpreter/mterp/riscv64/main.S
index 11428646adce5c0bf10a1d64cc715ee890cc0897..c3fec2f9e56f1ea8ce873c6af0b09dd433ec1ce0 100644
--- a/runtime/interpreter/mterp/riscv64/main.S
+++ b/runtime/interpreter/mterp/riscv64/main.S
@@ -486,8 +486,8 @@ OAT_ENTRY ExecuteNterpImpl
 
    // Fast path: instance with zero args.
 .Lentry_a1:
-   bexti s10, s10, ART_METHOD_IS_STATIC_FLAG_BIT
-                            // s10 := 1 if static, 0 if instance
+   srli s10, s10, ART_METHOD_IS_STATIC_FLAG_BIT
+   andi s10, s10, 1         // s10 := 1 if static, 0 if instance
    bnez s10, .Lentry_shorty
    sw a1, (t0)
    sw a1, (t1)
